 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 7.44,
   "text": "Recognizing these fundamental barriers explains why frontier industrial research laboratories",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.09,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 7.823,
   "e": 11.602,
   "text": "have converged on a brilliant architectural synthesis.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.778,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 12.95,
   "e": 20.472,
   "text": "Consider the breakthrough architecture of DeepSeek-V3, released in late 2024.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.521,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 21.172,
   "e": 28.551,
   "text": "The DeepSeek team did not abandon the Transformer in pursuit of unstructured biological plasticity.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.379,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 29.533,
   "e": 30.476,
   "text": "Instead,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 0.943,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 30.851,
   "e": 39.68,
   "text": "they engineered structural adaptability directly within the rigid mathematical geometry of dense tensor matrices.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.829,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 41.016,
   "e": 45.487,
   "text": "They achieved this through two revolutionary innovations.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.471,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 46.702,
   "e": 50.415,
   "text": "First, through fine-grained Mixture of Experts.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.713,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 51.665,
   "e": 58.488,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V3 deploys two hundred and fifty-six routed experts in each layer.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.823,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 58.807,
   "e": 64.642,
   "text": "For any given token, a routing gate dynamically activates only eight of them,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.835,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 64.883,
   "e": 69.319,
   "text": "alongside one shared expert that every token uses.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.436,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 70.585,
   "e": 76.234,
   "text": "This achieves extreme conditional specialization and sparse execution,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.649,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 76.606,
   "e": 85.304,
   "text": "while keeping every expert a dense, hardware-friendly matrix, connected through collective all-to-all communication primitives.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.698,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 86.279,
   "e": 90.98,
   "text": "Second, through Multi-head Latent Attention, or MLA.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.7,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 91.295,
   "e": 97.038,
   "text": "Instead of incurring massive memory bottlenecks with raw key-value caches,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.743,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 97.313,
   "e": 106.145,
   "text": "MLA dynamically compresses keys and values into a compact low-dimensional latent vector,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.832,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 106.394,
   "e": 110.336,
   "text": "decompressing them on the fly during attention computation.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.942,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 111.402,
   "e": 114.76,
   "text": "Notice how this resolves the paradox:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.358,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 114.867,
   "e": 123.324,
   "text": "frontier AI labs proved that modularity and dynamic routing do not come from abolishing the tensor monolith.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 8.457,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 124.39,
   "e": 132.175,
   "text": "They come from designing structured, hardware-aligned routing mechanisms on top of dense matrix multiplication.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.785,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 132.395,
   "e": 136.278,
   "text": "You gain the efficiency of conditional specialization",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.883,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 136.511,
   "e": 141.609,
   "text": "without paying the catastrophic cache penalty of irregular graph rewiring.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.097,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 142.664,
   "e": 147.962,
   "text": "By combining fine-grained mixture of experts with multi-head latent attention,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.298,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 148.126,
   "e": 157.29,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V3 activates only thirty-seven billion of its six hundred and seventy-one billion parameters per token,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 9.164,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 157.486,
   "e": 161.459,
   "text": "and its report describes a remarkably stable training run.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.973,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 161.679,
   "e": 165.127,
   "text": "Rather than letting the graph self-organize at random,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.448,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 165.528,
   "e": 171.893,
   "text": "the architecture uses learned soft routing over statically defined expert banks.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.365,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 172.685,
   "e": 177.149,
   "text": "Modularity is alive and thriving at the frontier,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.463,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 177.671,
   "e": 180.614,
   "text": "not as an unruly biological graph,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.943,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "s": 180.898,
   "e": 185.084,
   "text": "but as a disciplined mathematical routing system.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.186,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  }
 ]
}